      "task": {
        "task": "Make the cryptofs index store type immutable after index creation.",
        "subtasks": [
          "Add crypto-store validation to MetadataUpdateSettingsService during settings updates, using normalized settings, targeted indices, and the current cluster state.",
          "When index.store.type is explicitly included, reject changes from cryptofs to any other value, including null, and changes from any other store type to cryptofs. Throw an IllegalArgumentException identifying the affected index.",
          "Skip validation when index.store.type is absent, and allow unchanged cryptofs values and transitions between non-cryptofs store types.",
          "Add a changelog entry documenting crypto-store immutability validation."
        ]
      },
      "agent_task": "Task: Make the cryptofs index store type immutable after index creation.\n\nSubtasks:\n- Add crypto-store validation to MetadataUpdateSettingsService during settings updates, using normalized settings, targeted indices, and the current cluster state.\n- When index.store.type is explicitly included, reject changes from cryptofs to any other value, including null, and changes from any other store type to cryptofs. Throw an IllegalArgumentException identifying the affected index.\n- Skip validation when index.store.type is absent, and allow unchanged cryptofs values and transitions between non-cryptofs store types.\n- Add a changelog entry documenting crypto-store immutability validation.",
